      "core_meaning_cn": "核心不是简单“拿到”，而是停止拒绝：接受东西/提议，承认事实或现实，承担责任，或认可并接纳某人某物。",
      "core_meaning_en": "to stop rejecting something: receive or agree to it, recognize a truth or reality, take responsibility, or approve/include someone or something",
      "mental_model_cn": "先问“原本拒绝什么”：gift/offer→收下/同意；fact/that-clause→承认；bad reality→接受现实；responsibility→承担；person/paper/application→认可或接纳。",
      "mental_model_en": "identify what is no longer rejected: an item/offer, a fact/reality, responsibility, or a person/work judged suitable"
    },
